# Accepted Trivy findings. One entry per line: the ID, an expiry date, and a
# reason. Nothing is suppressed here without the reason written down, and every
# entry expires so it gets looked at again.
#
# AVD-DS-0002 / DS002: Dockerfile has no USER instruction.
#   The container MUST start as root: the entrypoint chowns the operator's key
#   bind mount and then drops to the `tor` user. A non-root USER
#   makes both impossible. The network-facing processes run as `tor`; `doctor`
#   verifies the capability set and no-new-privileges. See SECURITY.md.
AVD-DS-0002 exp:2027-03-01
DS002 exp:2027-03-01

